// Baseline executable operations for the final BellLabs schema proposal.
// Target: Neo4j 5.26 Community or Enterprise (statements below run on Community 5.26.31). Idempotent (IF NOT EXISTS).
// Generated from the final SDL by gen-operations.mjs; hand-written sections follow the generated ones.

